        "model": "bai/qwen3.8-flash",
        "v": 5,
        "title": "Add house subscription billing experiment split",
        "summary": "Added `houseSubscriptionBillingArmForUser` and `HOUSE_SUBSCRIPTION_BILLING_EXPERIMENT` to `common/src/util/ad-experiment.ts`. Implements a sticky 50/50 split between monthly and yearly billing for the Freebuff house-subscription promotion, using a dedicated dated salt (`house_subscription_billing_2026_09`) to isolate this acquisition experiment from ad routing. Assignment is deterministic via `fnv1a` hash of the salt and user ID, ensuring stability across sessions and pods.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-14T03:37:07.035Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "You are in a 50/50 split for how you're asked to pay for the Freebuff house subscription: half of eligible users see a monthly price and half see a yearly price. Your assignment is locked to your account, so you keep the same billing option every time you visit, across all sessions and servers. The experiment uses today's date in its identity, so anyone moved into the other half from now on gets a fresh, consistent assignment. No other experiments or offers affect which price you see.",
