        "title": "Add SubscriptionCostMetrics and SubscriptionCostReport types",
        "summary": "New `common/src/types/subscription-costs.ts` defines `SubscriptionCostMetrics` and `SubscriptionCostReport` interfaces. These types standardize the shape of cost data for paid subscribers, covering net provider dollars, subscription-funded portions, unattributed costs, and 30-day forecasts. The `SubscriptionCostReport` includes cohort-level aggregates (`users`, `tiers`, `totals`) and metadata like `attributionComplete` to flag missing funding attribution. This is a shared core type addition, preparing the data layer for cost reporting features.",
        "significance": "minor",
